prior written permission from the relevant author or authorized rights holder.
This includes personal, educational, noncommercial and commercial purposes.

Requests, attribution, preserved notices, repository stars and general
correspondence do not themselves grant permission. An authorization is limited
to its express written scope, conditions and term, and does not implicitly
grant a right to sublicense. Contact the maintainer to identify the relevant
rights holder and request permission:
https://github.com/yakasuka/yggdrasil/issues

3. Applicable law, platform terms and existing permissions

Nothing in this notice restricts acts permitted without permission by
applicable law, expands the statutory scope of copyright, or revokes previously
valid permissions. Rights provided by GitHub's Terms of Service, including
viewing and forking within the platform, remain subject to those terms. Such
rights do not themselves grant a general license for other use, execution,
modification or redistribution. Applicable law and valid permissions govern.

4. Third-party material

Third-party code, rule sets, fonts, icons, images, trademarks and other material
remain subject to their respective ownership and applicable terms. This notice
does not replace, narrow or revoke third-party grants, or grant rights that the
