automatically make third-party material the exclusive property of the authors.
See README.md, icons/macosicons/README.md, the manifest.json in that directory,
and upstream sources for attribution and provenance.

5. Disclaimer

To the fullest extent permitted by applicable law, the Work is provided
"AS IS", without express or implied warranties, including merchantability,
fitness for a particular purpose and noninfringement. The authors and rights
holders are not liable for losses arising from use of or inability to use the
